====== TP-Link TL-WDR3320 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

Dual Band (concurrent) and 100mbps Ethernet.
Advertised as 600 Mbps it is Dual-Stream (2x2) on the 2.4 GHz Band and Dual-Stream (2x2) on the 5 GHz Band. Similar to [[tl-wdr3500_v1|TP-Link TL-WDR3500]]

